#: F3 / G6. A band-limited version of the SAME utterance must score CLOSER than a
#: DIFFERENT SPEAKER. A metric that fails this is measuring spectral SUPPORT, not
#: fidelity, and cannot order decoders: a narrowband but otherwise faithful
