BAND_LIMITS_HZ = (7000.0, 6000.0, 4000.0, 2000.0)

#: The band-limits G6 GATES ON, and the reason the range stops where it does.
#:
#: At REFERENCE-COMMON = 16 kHz every signal spans 0-8 kHz, and every arm's own
#: output rate (16 / 22.05 / 24 / 44.1 kHz) puts its Nyquist at or above 8 kHz.
#: A decoder at this denominator can therefore lose high band only by ROLLING
